      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2643,
      "text": "How many towns did I give respite when they were wrongdoers, and then I seized them. And to Me is the final return.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 290,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2644,
      "text": "Say, “O people, I am only sent to you as a clear warner.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 291,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2645,
      "text": "Those who believe and do righteous deeds will have forgiveness and a generous provision.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 291,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2646,
      "text": "But those who strive to discredit Our verses[25], they are the people of the Blazing Fire.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 291,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2647,
      "text": "We did not send any messenger or prophet before you except that when he recited, Satan would cast into it [some misunderstanding]. But Allah would abolish what Satan casts, then Allah would confirm His verses[26], for Allah is All-Knowing, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 291,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2648,
      "text": "[That is] so that He may make what Satan casts a trial for those [hypocrites] whose hearts are sick[27] and those [disbelievers] whose hearts are hardened, for indeed the wrongdoers are in extreme dissension.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 291,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2649,
      "text": "And so that those who were given knowledge may know that this [Qur’an] is the truth from your Lord, so they may believe in it and their hearts may become humbled to it. Allah surely guides those who believe to the straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 22,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحَجِّ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hajj",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pilgrimage",
        "numberOfAyahs": 78,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 338,
      "ruku": 291,
      "hizbQuarter": 135,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2650,
      "text": "Yet the disbelievers will persist in doubt about it until the Hour comes upon them suddenly or there comes upon them the punishment of a barren Day[28].",
